{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうもかわごぴーです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/02/29/4909669/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年中しくじってる、ぴーです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目標を\n立てたところで\n見た目だよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはかわごぴー教訓○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俯瞰で見て生きてるので\nネガティブとかじゃなく\n周りと自分を見て審査した結果学んだこと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/02/29/4909669/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしは\nそれでも現状をみて先を考えてるので\n0でいるわけじゃないよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/02/29/4909669/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/02/29/4909669/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしのふぁんに誤解うんでたら申し訳ない。すみません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/02/29/4909669/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ乃木坂は美人多いからさ\n生きずれええって思ったことあるから\nあえてアイドルが言わないことゆったよ\n身を削った～～～でもその分違うとこで頑張るのだ！ポジティブ人間"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/02/29/4909669/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/02/29/4909669/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風も見た目で判断してきたぞ、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/02/29/4909669/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/02/29/4909669/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/02/29/4909669/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"FLASHスペシャルのオフショット♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなひなひなこ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生まれてはじめて\n名前のひなで得した日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなで仕事やってみたかったから嬉しい\nFLASHさまに感謝！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/02/29/4909669/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしもっとグラビアやりたいぞ、\nビジュアルが追いついていないとかいいつつ\n貪欲だからやりたいぞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつだかの季刊乃木坂で話題になったからな(?)\nグラビア路線いけるかもしれぬぞ\nもうすぐ18だしな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/02/29/4909669/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/02/29/4909669/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鬼はーそとー\n福はーうちー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ"}],"source":"archive"}